# Clean GRCh38 ELS source pools by chromosome

This directory contains chromosome-specific enhancer-positive BED files generated
by `src/get_whole_body_regulatory_sets.sh`. The source SCREEN ELS collection is
deduplicated by cCRE ID, and every locus overlapping a unique SVN locus by at
least one base is excluded before chromosome splitting.

| chromosome | complete_SCREEN_ELS | silencer_loci_removed | clean_positive_loci |
|:-----------|--------------------:|-----------------------:|--------------------:|
| chr1  | 153,196 | 28,920 | 124,276 |
| chr2  | 144,254 | 14,291 | 129,963 |
| chr3  | 113,596 | 9,583 | 104,013 |
| chr4  | 86,232 | 10,835 | 75,397 |
| chr5  | 97,469 | 10,498 | 86,971 |
| chr6  | 101,231 | 16,221 | 85,010 |
| chr7  | 90,955 | 8,265 | 82,690 |
| chr8  | 83,028 | 7,324 | 75,704 |
| chr9  | 74,200 | 10,466 | 63,734 |
| chr10 | 85,396 | 7,817 | 77,579 |
| chr11 | 85,530 | 12,053 | 73,477 |
| chr12 | 83,790 | 7,555 | 76,235 |
| chr13 | 47,845 | 1,427 | 46,418 |
