| chrY  | 1,837 | 0 | 1,837 |
| **Total** | **1,718,669** | **196,083** | **1,522,586** |

The removed count for each chromosome equals the unique SVN-positive count for
that chromosome. Across the complete datasets, residual EVN/SVN overlap is zero,
and the clean EVN collection contains no duplicate cCRE IDs.

Each positive BED is stored as:

`chrom<chrom>/chrom<chrom>_GRCh38_ELS.bed`

Only cleaned positive BEDs have been generated at this stage. Positive FASTAs and
synthetic or real-genomic background sets must be regenerated from these BEDs.
Their generated and missing-negative counts are therefore intentionally not
reported yet. The old overlapping source pools and their historical negative
counts remain under `../overlaps/chroms/`.
